        "id": 1000016
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-03-19T09:20:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is an internal function, the only one calling with a user provided parameter is cmd_fp_frame() but you cannot do the check against FP_MAX_FINGER_COUNT as it\u0027s not part of the Host-EC interface (aka ec_commands.h) and overall you cannot compile board-specific parameter in ectool, it\u0027s usually not compiled from the same branch and backward-compatible with older EC (as it is from ToT).\nwe could run a check against the dynamic value returned in the fp_info structure but ectool is a debug and test tool: without doing it, it will fail below in the EC_CMD_FP_FRAME call (EC will return EC_RES_INVALID_PARAM) and I can still test my MCU interface.",
